Command Substitution:
===============
A variable to be declared by executing a command and the output we are going to store in a variable.
# Syntax
var=$(command)

# Example
DATE=$(date)


Arithmetic Substitution:
A variable to be declared by evaluating an Arithmetic expression and output we are going to store in a variable.
# Syntax
var=$((expression))

# Example
sum=$((2+5))

